{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 0, "to": 15000}, "text": " All right, I'm here with Phil and your, what's your call sign?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 16000}, "text": " BK2BDF."}, {"offsets": {"from": 16000, "to": 17000}, "text": " BK2BDF?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 18000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 18000, "to": 24000}, "text": " Excellent. And you're going to show us a really neat home-built spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 25000}, "text": " Spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 26000}, "text": " Tell us all about it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 27000, "to": 32000}, "text": " Very, very long time ago, when the radio club was first building the two-meter repeater,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 32000, "to": 35000}, "text": " we were having terrible trouble getting the cavities working."}, {"offsets": {"from": 35000, "to": 36000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 36000, "to": 41000}, "text": " And we had very limited access to RF test equipment."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 42000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 42000, "to": 47000}, "text": " I worked in a RF laboratory and had access to a spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 48000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 48000, "to": 50000}, "text": " And I just wish I had one at home."}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 51000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 57000}, "text": " I decided there was no way I was ever going to be able to afford a Hewlett-Packard spectrum analyzer in those days."}, {"offsets": {"from": 57000, "to": 58000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 62000}, "text": " Late 70s, early 80s. So I decided to build one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 62000, "to": 65000}, "text": " Excellent. All right. And this is the result."}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 66000}, "text": " And this is it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 66000, "to": 67000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 75000}, "text": " This device has been used to get the cavities working for the original two-meter repeater for the radio club."}, {"offsets": {"from": 75000, "to": 76000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 76000, "to": 87000}, "text": " And several times since for EMC testing of various pieces of commercial equipment."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 88000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 88000, "to": 96000}, "text": " Probably the most recent and valuable was the traffic light controller I've been working on for many years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96000, "to": 97000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 104000}, "text": " Had a leakage of 160-meg signal out of the microprocessors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 104000, "to": 107000}, "text": " Right. And you were able to track that down using this beast?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 107000, "to": 112000}, "text": " We took the traffic light controller up to Colo, to the open-air test site."}, {"offsets": {"from": 112000, "to": 113000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 114000}, "text": " They failed it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 115000}, "text": " Ha, ha, ha."}, {"offsets": {"from": 115000, "to": 119000}, "text": " And they said that signal's got to go down about 10 dBs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 120000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 127000}, "text": " I brought it home and set up the traffic light controller in my carport, used the spectrum analyzer with a dipole antenna."}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 128000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 132000}, "text": " And went through board by board until I found where the problem was."}, {"offsets": {"from": 132000, "to": 133000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 133000, "to": 137000}, "text": " And fixed it, went back to Colo and got it passed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 137000, "to": 138000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 140000}, "text": " Yeah, it's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140000, "to": 148000}, "text": " All right, so tell us how it's, tell us, explain all the sections in here and tell us how a homebrew spectrum analyzer works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 148000, "to": 152000}, "text": " Well, a spectrum analyzer is really just a radio receiver."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 153000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 153000, "to": 161000}, "text": " Where the last detector stage is a logarithmic amplifier instead of a linear voice detector."}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 162000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162000, "to": 165000}, "text": " It's very much like an AM receiver."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 168000}, "text": " There's no gain controls."}, {"offsets": {"from": 168000, "to": 171000}, "text": " It just runs flat out all the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 176000}, "text": " But the last stage, the detector, which is this last section here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 176000, "to": 177000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 179000}, "text": " Is a logarithmic amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 179000, "to": 180000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 180000, "to": 187000}, "text": " That just takes a 10.7 MHz signal and rectifies it like an AM detector."}, {"offsets": {"from": 187000, "to": 188000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 196000}, "text": " But it's set up so that the output of the detector is logarithmically proportional to the input."}, {"offsets": {"from": 196000, "to": 197000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 197000, "to": 202000}, "text": " So it has, we were working out before, it has about 70 dBs of gain."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202000, "to": 203000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 203000, "to": 206000}, "text": " So 60 dBs is 1,000 times in voltage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206000, "to": 207000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 208000}, "text": " Another 10 is another three."}, {"offsets": {"from": 208000, "to": 212000}, "text": " So about 3,000 times in voltage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 212000, "to": 216000}, "text": " And that equates to the height of my screen."}, {"offsets": {"from": 216000, "to": 217000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 224000}, "text": " So these signals here, that's about 40 dBs down from the top of the screen."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224000, "to": 225000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 227000}, "text": " So the noise floor is what, minus 70 or thereabouts, is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 227000, "to": 229000}, "text": " Yeah, about 70."}, {"offsets": {"from": 229000, "to": 230000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 234000}, "text": " I'm not sure where the other signals are from."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234000, "to": 238000}, "text": " And what sweep range are we looking at there at the moment?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 238000, "to": 240000}, "text": " That's the zero mark."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240000, "to": 241000}, "text": " Oh, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 242000}, "text": " OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 242000, "to": 243000}, "text": " Up to 200 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 243000, "to": 244000}, "text": " 200 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 247000}, "text": " 200, about, it tops out at about 200 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 248000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 248000, "to": 249000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 249000, "to": 251000}, "text": " Somewhere here will be the page and transmitters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 251000, "to": 253000}, "text": " There's somebody transmitting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 254000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 254000, "to": 255000}, "text": " Somebody around us."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255000, "to": 256000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 259000}, "text": " Yeah, everyone's got a transmitter around here, like on his belt there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 259000, "to": 260000}, "text": " Who's got a handheld?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 260000, "to": 263000}, "text": " Can you key up your handheld?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 264000}, "text": " Handheld."}, {"offsets": {"from": 264000, "to": 266000}, "text": " Can you just key up your handheld?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 266000, "to": 267000}, "text": " Key it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 267000, "to": 268000}, "text": " Can you frequency?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 268000, "to": 270000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 271000}, "text": " And?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 271000, "to": 272000}, "text": " And?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 272000, "to": 274000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 274000, "to": 275000}, "text": " Oh, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 275000, "to": 276000}, "text": " Look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 276000, "to": 277000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 277000, "to": 279000}, "text": " You've got to be kidding."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 281000}, "text": " You're allowed on the air with that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 284000}, "text": " Oops."}, {"offsets": {"from": 284000, "to": 286000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 286000, "to": 287000}, "text": " Thanks, Ben."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287000, "to": 288000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 288000, "to": 291000}, "text": " We might have momentarily overloaded the front end."}, {"offsets": {"from": 291000, "to": 292000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 293000}, "text": " Anyway, that was him there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 293000, "to": 294000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 294000, "to": 295000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295000, "to": 297000}, "text": " So that's 146 megs about there somewhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297000, "to": 298000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 298000, "to": 301000}, "text": " That'll be the 147 megs paging transmitters?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 301000, "to": 303000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 303000, "to": 305000}, "text": " Well, I'm not sure where 88 to 108 is gone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 310000}, "text": " There was a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 310000, "to": 312000}, "text": " That's all the FM broadcast transmitters in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 312000, "to": 313000}, "text": " Oh, it's on narrow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313000, "to": 317000}, "text": " That's why I can't see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 317000, "to": 318000}, "text": " There they are all there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 318000, "to": 319000}, "text": " Ah, there they are."}, {"offsets": {"from": 319000, "to": 321000}, "text": " They're the FM transmitters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 321000, "to": 322000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 322000, "to": 324000}, "text": " There are the local FM stations."}, {"offsets": {"from": 324000, "to": 325000}, "text": " 88 to 108 megs?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 325000, "to": 326000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 326000, "to": 327000}, "text": " That's them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 327000, "to": 328000}, "text": " Spot on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 328000, "to": 330000}, "text": " So can you tell us about all the sections,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 330000, "to": 332000}, "text": " starting from the antenna input?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 332000, "to": 333000}, "text": " Oh, the antenna input."}, {"offsets": {"from": 333000, "to": 334000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 336000}, "text": " Comes down into the front-end mixer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 336000, "to": 337000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 337000, "to": 339000}, "text": " Now, the mixer takes the RF signals,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 339000, "to": 341000}, "text": " mixes it with the voltage-controlled oscillator."}, {"offsets": {"from": 341000, "to": 342000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 342000, "to": 346000}, "text": " And that produces a 205 meg IF."}, {"offsets": {"from": 346000, "to": 347000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 347000, "to": 353000}, "text": " This receiver actually converts up rather than converts down like a traditional receiver."}, {"offsets": {"from": 353000, "to": 355000}, "text": " This can only work this way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 355000, "to": 356000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 356000, "to": 357000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 357000, "to": 358000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 358000, "to": 364000}, "text": " Because we're trying to churn everywhere from zero frequency to 200 megs,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 364000, "to": 367000}, "text": " you've got to take that and convert it up to a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 367000, "to": 368000}, "text": " And convert it up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 368000, "to": 372000}, "text": " ...to an IF that's higher than the signals you're trying to receive."}, {"offsets": {"from": 372000, "to": 373000}, "text": " Of course. Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 373000, "to": 379000}, "text": " So the first filter here is somewhere around 205 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 379000, "to": 380000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 380000, "to": 385000}, "text": " That comes down into a homemade double-balanced diode mixer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 385000, "to": 387000}, "text": " That does look like a double-balanced mixer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 387000, "to": 389000}, "text": " You can see the four diodes in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 389000, "to": 390000}, "text": " Yeah, and the little toroids."}, {"offsets": {"from": 390000, "to": 394000}, "text": " And the little toroids because that's all that's in a double-balanced mixer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 394000, "to": 395000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395000, "to": 398000}, "text": " So this section here is just a crystal oscillator and multiplier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 398000, "to": 399000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 399000, "to": 404000}, "text": " And that's mixing that 200 megs down to about 50 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 404000, "to": 405000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 407000}, "text": " The frequencies are not terribly important."}, {"offsets": {"from": 407000, "to": 411000}, "text": " They're based on what crystals I had in my junk box at the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 411000, "to": 412000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 412000, "to": 413000}, "text": " The whole thing works that way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 413000, "to": 414000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 415000, "to": 421000}, "text": " So just a filter and then a bandpass filter of, I'll say, 56 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 421000, "to": 422000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 422000, "to": 426000}, "text": " And then another crystal oscillator, another double-balanced mixer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 426000, "to": 427000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 427000, "to": 433000}, "text": " And that mixes down to 10.7 megs out through..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 433000, "to": 436000}, "text": " Yeah, through that coax into here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 436000, "to": 437000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 437000, "to": 440000}, "text": " And this is just a 10.7 meg IF amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 440000, "to": 442000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 442000, "to": 444000}, "text": " Ceramic bandpass filter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 444000, "to": 445000}, "text": " There it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 445000, "to": 447000}, "text": " Yeah, I can see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 447000, "to": 452000}, "text": " Then it comes through into this section and then it splits two ways with a diode switch."}, {"offsets": {"from": 452000, "to": 458000}, "text": " It either goes straight through for wideband, wideband being 250 kilohertz."}, {"offsets": {"from": 458000, "to": 459000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 459000, "to": 464000}, "text": " Or it goes across through those crystal filters for narrowband, which is 15 kilohertz."}, {"offsets": {"from": 464000, "to": 466000}, "text": " And that's the switch on the front."}, {"offsets": {"from": 466000, "to": 468000}, "text": " That's this one here, narrow-wide."}, {"offsets": {"from": 468000, "to": 470000}, "text": " Wide and narrowband, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 470000, "to": 476000}, "text": " Then just into some more amplifiers, which then feeds back into that logarithmic amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 476000, "to": 478000}, "text": " At the end, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478000, "to": 480000}, "text": " And that's our final output."}, {"offsets": {"from": 480000, "to": 483000}, "text": " The output of the logarithmic amplifier comes out into the crow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 483000, "to": 484000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 484000, "to": 488000}, "text": " As the vertical input or video input to the crow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 488000, "to": 494000}, "text": " The oscillator is actually being swept from this oscilloscope, the horizontal time base."}, {"offsets": {"from": 494000, "to": 497000}, "text": " Oh, you're taking the horizontal time base out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 497000, "to": 498000}, "text": " Out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 498000, "to": 499000}, "text": " Ah!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 499000, "to": 501000}, "text": " And it's fed back into this amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 501000, "to": 502000}, "text": " Ah, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 502000, "to": 503000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 503000, "to": 505000}, "text": " And that drives the voltage-controlled oscillator."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505000, "to": 506000}, "text": " I got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 506000, "to": 508000}, "text": " So that it can synchronize with it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 508000, "to": 510000}, "text": " The frequency is actually being swept."}, {"offsets": {"from": 510000, "to": 511000}, "text": " Swept on the..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 511000, "to": 512000}, "text": " With the..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 512000, "to": 513000}, "text": " Very clever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 513000, "to": 514000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 514000, "to": 515000}, "text": " Very clever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515000, "to": 516000}, "text": " But that's our spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 516000, "to": 520000}, "text": " Yeah, but to integrate it with a scope like that is neat."}, {"offsets": {"from": 520000, "to": 524000}, "text": " Yeah, I could afford to buy the scope, but not a spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 524000, "to": 525000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 525000, "to": 528000}, "text": " And these are all hand-wound inductors?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 528000, "to": 530000}, "text": " Yeah, little hand-wound chokes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 530000, "to": 531000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 531000, "to": 533000}, "text": " But yeah, the thing's full of hand-wound coils."}, {"offsets": {"from": 533000, "to": 535000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 535000, "to": 536000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 536000, "to": 537000}, "text": " It's all built on..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 537000, "to": 540000}, "text": " The base is a piece of little print circuit board."}, {"offsets": {"from": 540000, "to": 541000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 541000, "to": 542000}, "text": " And then copper..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 542000, "to": 543000}, "text": " Copper shield."}, {"offsets": {"from": 543000, "to": 544000}, "text": " Shielding around."}, {"offsets": {"from": 544000, "to": 545000}, "text": " Soldered in on top of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545000, "to": 546000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 546000, "to": 548000}, "text": " And you don't need to shield the tops of them?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 548000, "to": 550000}, "text": " Ah, well, there's the..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 550000, "to": 551000}, "text": " Ah, well, okay, you've got shielded plates."}, {"offsets": {"from": 551000, "to": 552000}, "text": " There's the..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 552000, "to": 553000}, "text": " Okay, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 553000, "to": 554000}, "text": " The lids."}, {"offsets": {"from": 554000, "to": 555000}, "text": " The lids."}, {"offsets": {"from": 555000, "to": 556000}, "text": " The lids."}, {"offsets": {"from": 558000, "to": 560000}, "text": " Not all the boxes ever got shielded."}, {"offsets": {"from": 560000, "to": 561000}, "text": " That was it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 561000, "to": 562000}, "text": " Yeah, right, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 562000, "to": 565000}, "text": " So the performance is still fairly adequate even without the shield?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 565000, "to": 566000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 566000, "to": 569000}, "text": " We were actually looking at a signal before."}, {"offsets": {"from": 572000, "to": 573000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 573000, "to": 574000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 574000, "to": 575000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 580000, "to": 584000}, "text": " That is both that one and that one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 584000, "to": 587000}, "text": " That's probably the crystal and that's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 587000, "to": 589000}, "text": " Yep, that looks like feeding back."}, {"offsets": {"from": 589000, "to": 592000}, "text": " So there's picking up near the crystal?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 592000, "to": 593000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 593000, "to": 595000}, "text": " So that's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 595000, "to": 598000}, "text": " Anyway, they look like they're double the frequency to me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 598000, "to": 599000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600000, "to": 606000}, "text": " So that's the second local oscillator being picked up by the system itself."}, {"offsets": {"from": 606000, "to": 607000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 607000, "to": 613000}, "text": " But if you disconnect the antenna completely and put the shields on..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 613000, "to": 615000}, "text": " That's your noise floor, yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 615000, "to": 616000}, "text": " That's not..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 616000, "to": 619000}, "text": " No, there's not much left."}, {"offsets": {"from": 619000, "to": 620000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 620000, "to": 622000}, "text": " And, you know, that could actually be a signal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 622000, "to": 625000}, "text": " It could be sneaking in, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 625000, "to": 627000}, "text": " Yeah, there's a couple down here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 627000, "to": 630000}, "text": " Yeah, there's not much there until you put the antenna on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 630000, "to": 631000}, "text": " Sure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 634000, "to": 635000}, "text": " Very nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 635000, "to": 640000}, "text": " When I connect the spectrum analyzer up to my beam, I'm down at Beacon Hill."}, {"offsets": {"from": 640000, "to": 641000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 641000, "to": 642000}, "text": " Down in the gully."}, {"offsets": {"from": 642000, "to": 645000}, "text": " I can get the receiver about S9."}, {"offsets": {"from": 645000, "to": 646000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 646000, "to": 650000}, "text": " I can put the spectrum analyzer on the beam, key up the repeater,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 650000, "to": 653000}, "text": " and actually see the repeater come back."}, {"offsets": {"from": 653000, "to": 654000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 654000, "to": 655000}, "text": " It just pops up here as a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 655000, "to": 656000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 656000, "to": 658000}, "text": " It's only just popping out of the noise."}, {"offsets": {"from": 658000, "to": 659000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 659000, "to": 662000}, "text": " That's the sort of sensitivity that the device has."}, {"offsets": {"from": 662000, "to": 663000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 663000, "to": 669000}, "text": " It doesn't go down to, yeah, microvolts like a normal ham radio would."}, {"offsets": {"from": 669000, "to": 675000}, "text": " I'm not sure what the smaller signal is, but, yeah, 10 or 20 microvolts probably."}, {"offsets": {"from": 675000, "to": 677000}, "text": " Yep, something like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 677000, "to": 680000}, "text": " So would you, if you were building a spectrum analyzer,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 680000, "to": 685000}, "text": " a discrete spectrum analyzer, would you do it the same now?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 685000, "to": 687000}, "text": " Or would you use similar styles?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 687000, "to": 688000}, "text": " Pretty much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 688000, "to": 689000}, "text": " Yeah, similar components?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 689000, "to": 691000}, "text": " When I first looked at it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 691000, "to": 695000}, "text": " the voltage-controlled oscillator was always going to be a problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 695000, "to": 696000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 696000, "to": 700000}, "text": " And I rang up, I won't say who."}, {"offsets": {"from": 700000, "to": 701000}, "text": " Right, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 701000, "to": 707000}, "text": " The place up at Hornsby that sells all the fancy RF equipment and mini-circuits."}, {"offsets": {"from": 707000, "to": 708000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 708000, "to": 713000}, "text": " And I priced what's called a YIG oscillator, Y-I-G."}, {"offsets": {"from": 713000, "to": 716000}, "text": " It's an acronym for something, and I can't remember what it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 716000, "to": 721000}, "text": " A YIG oscillator is a magnetically-tuned sphere oscillator."}, {"offsets": {"from": 721000, "to": 722000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 722000, "to": 724000}, "text": " And it's the heart of a real spectrum analyzer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 724000, "to": 725000}, "text": " Mm-hmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 725000, "to": 729000}, "text": " And I wanted one that tuned, you know, 2,000 to 3,000 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 729000, "to": 730000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 730000, "to": 731000}, "text": " And it was $2,500."}, {"offsets": {"from": 731000, "to": 732000}, "text": " $2,500."}, {"offsets": {"from": 732000, "to": 734000}, "text": " This was back when?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 734000, "to": 735000}, "text": " Long time ago."}, {"offsets": {"from": 735000, "to": 736000}, "text": " Late 70s, early 80s."}, {"offsets": {"from": 736000, "to": 738000}, "text": " Late 70s, early 80s."}, {"offsets": {"from": 738000, "to": 740000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 740000, "to": 746000}, "text": " Nah, there's just no way I was going to spend that much money on a little oscillator in a box."}, {"offsets": {"from": 746000, "to": 751000}, "text": " Well, nowadays everyone's doing it with a software-defined radio these days."}, {"offsets": {"from": 751000, "to": 753000}, "text": " It's just not the same, is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 753000, "to": 754000}, "text": " Yeah, it's not."}, {"offsets": {"from": 754000, "to": 755000}, "text": " It's not the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 755000, "to": 759000}, "text": " There was some spectrum analyzer kits that came out years after this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 759000, "to": 762000}, "text": " where they actually used a TV tuner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 762000, "to": 763000}, "text": " I remember that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 763000, "to": 767000}, "text": " An electronically-tuned TV tuner, not turret tuners."}, {"offsets": {"from": 767000, "to": 768000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 768000, "to": 771000}, "text": " But they had enough range that, yeah,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 771000, "to": 775000}, "text": " you could build a half-reasonable spectrum analyzer out of a TV tuner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 775000, "to": 776000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 776000, "to": 778000}, "text": " Would it have a decent noise floor in it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 778000, "to": 780000}, "text": " Well, you had to build all the back end of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 780000, "to": 781000}, "text": " Yeah, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 781000, "to": 782000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 782000, "to": 783000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 783000, "to": 784000}, "text": " So, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 784000, "to": 788000}, "text": " But, yeah, $700, you can buy a spectrum analyzer that works better than this today."}, {"offsets": {"from": 788000, "to": 789000}, "text": " Yeah, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 789000, "to": 790000}, "text": " Of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 790000, "to": 791000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 791000, "to": 795000}, "text": " But still, that is very nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 795000, "to": 798000}, "text": " It's a sort of dead bug-style construction,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 798000, "to": 802000}, "text": " or as the Yanks call it, Manhattan-style construction."}, {"offsets": {"from": 802000, "to": 804000}, "text": " And it's just beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 804000, "to": 805000}, "text": " Phil, that is awesome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 805000, "to": 806000}, "text": " Thank you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 806000, "to": 807000}, "text": " Well done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 807000, "to": 808000}, "text": " Thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 808000, "to": 809000}, "text": " You're welcome."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}